# Claw Command - seasonal and novelty bar drinks.

## Christmas

reagent-name-cinnamon-cola = Space Cola Cinnamon
reagent-desc-cinnamon-cola = The classic taste of Space Cola with a hint of warm cinnamon flavor.

reagent-name-space-up-cranberry = Space-Up Cranberry
reagent-desc-space-up-cranberry = Space-Up with a cranberry and spice twist. Citrus intermingles with tart cranberry and a hint of spice.

reagent-name-peppermint-mocha = vanilla peppermint mocha
reagent-desc-peppermint-mocha = A nice, tasty beverage for the holiday season.

reagent-name-caramel-whiskey = caramel whiskey
reagent-desc-caramel-whiskey = A decadent caramel-flavored whiskey. A cloyingly sweet mixture of whiskey and salted caramel.

reagent-name-peppermint-schnapps = peppermint schnapps
reagent-desc-peppermint-schnapps = A mint-flavored drink bottled at much higher proof than usual liqueurs. A surprisingly potent liqueur with a bracing, icy flavor.

reagent-name-caramel-white-russian = Caramel White Russian
reagent-desc-caramel-white-russian = Caramel whiskey, coffee liqueur and a generous serving of cream for good measure. Who's to say russians can't drink whiskey once in a while?

reagent-name-peppermint-martini = peppermint martini
reagent-desc-peppermint-martini = A simple holiday cocktail that essentially dilutes high-proof peppermint schnapps to a drinkable level. This one even has a colored sugar rim.

reagent-name-stinger = Stinger
reagent-desc-stinger = A classic cocktail which became associated with high society during the early 1900s. You feel like some kind of 1920s tycoon just by holding this.

reagent-name-naughty-girl-scout = Naughty Girl Scout
reagent-desc-naughty-girl-scout = A cocktail leveraging peppermint's interplay with coffee and chocolate flavors. The classic mint and chocolate pairing, but now in alcoholic form.

## Halloween

reagent-name-licorice-cola = Space Cola Licorice
reagent-desc-licorice-cola = The classic taste of Space Cola infused with black and red licorice mix.

reagent-name-dr-gibb-mystery = Dr. Gibb Mystery
reagent-desc-dr-gibb-mystery = A proudly mysterious halloween-themed variant of Dr. Gibb.

reagent-name-pumpkin-spice-latte = pumpkin spice latte
reagent-desc-pumpkin-spice-latte = A nice, tasty beverage for the halloween season.

reagent-name-sour-apple-schnapps = sour apple schnapps
reagent-desc-sour-apple-schnapps = A strong artificially-flavoured liqueur meant for mixing. Something tells you it would be unwise to drink this straight.

reagent-name-candy-corn-vodka = candy corn vodka
reagent-desc-candy-corn-vodka = Vodka infused with an assortment of artificial flavourings to mimic the taste of candy corn. Practically candy in a glass.

reagent-name-appletini = appletini
reagent-desc-appletini = A bright-green cocktail originally designed to not taste like alcohol. If it goes in the V-shaped glass, it's a Martini. Simple as.

reagent-name-sour-apple-mimosa = sour apple mimosa
reagent-desc-sour-apple-mimosa = A green apple-based twist on the Mimosa. Just as refreshing.

reagent-name-sour-apple-fizz = sour apple fizz
reagent-desc-sour-apple-fizz = A low-proof drink consisting of sour apple schnapps and lime juice diluted into soda water. The Mojito wishes it could be this green.

reagent-name-candy-corn-martini = candy corn martini
reagent-desc-candy-corn-martini = A classic halloween cocktail, meant to be carefully layered in the glass to look like the candy.

reagent-name-halloween-punch = halloween punch
reagent-desc-halloween-punch = A neon-orange beverage consisting of fruit juices and flavoured vodka. Commonly made in large quantities for halloween parties. It's staring at you!

## Angel ichor line

reagent-name-angel-ichor = angel ichor
reagent-desc-angel-ichor = A premium alcoholic beverage made from distilled angel blood. A very pious looking drink.

reagent-name-holy-mary = Holy Mary
reagent-desc-holy-mary = A strange yet pleasurable mixture made of vodka, angel's ichor and lime juice. Or at least you THINK the yellow stuff is angel's ichor.

reagent-name-angels-wrath = Angels' Wrath
reagent-desc-angels-wrath = This thing makes the hair on the back of your neck stand up. Just looking at it makes you sweat.

reagent-name-angels-kiss = Angel's Kiss
reagent-desc-angels-kiss = Miracle time!

reagent-name-ichor-mead = ichor mead
reagent-desc-ichor-mead = A trip to Valhalla.

reagent-name-original-sin = Original Sin
reagent-desc-original-sin = Angel ichor, entirely transformed by one drop of apple juice. A drink so fine, you may just risk eternal damnation!

reagent-name-gods-sake = God's Sake
reagent-desc-gods-sake = Anime's favorite drink.

reagent-name-godka = Godka
reagent-desc-godka = Number one drink AND fueling choice for Russians multiverse-wide. The glass is barely able to contain the wodka. Xynta.

godka-effect-woozy = You feel woozy...

## Engine-room oddities

reagent-name-oil-slick = oil slick
reagent-desc-oil-slick = A viscous, but sweet, ooze. A concoction that should probably be in an engine, rather than your stomach.

reagent-name-nuclear-waste = nuclear waste
reagent-desc-nuclear-waste = A viscous, glowing slurry. Sadly, no super powers.

## Odd cocktails

reagent-name-space-bulldog = Space Bulldog
reagent-desc-space-bulldog = An inventive coffee liqueur recipe. It looks like someone poured cola in a cup of coffee.

reagent-name-negroni-sbagliato = Negroni Sbagliato
reagent-desc-negroni-sbagliato = A drink invented because a bartender was too drunk. Bubbles constantly pop up to the surface with a quiet fizz.

reagent-name-italian-crisis = Italian Crisis
reagent-desc-italian-crisis = This drink was concocted by a madwoman, causing the Italian Crisis of 2123. It looks like it was a mistake.

